Description: R interface to query UCSC bigWig files using UCSC Genome Browser
    code (Kent et al.). Supports all bigWig access modes including HTTP access
    to remote files. Provides probe-level and base-pair resolution queries,
    strand-aware metaprofile computation, and mappability correction via
    bwMap objects.
biocViews: Coverage, DataImport, Sequencing, Visualization
Imports: boot
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
